{"Title":"An Act relative to private detectives and private investigators","BillNumber":"H3289","DocketNumber":"HD4007","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"R_C1","Name":"Rob Consalvo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:05:08.36"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"R_C1","Name":"Rob Consalvo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T16:05:08.36"},{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-04T14:06:08.23"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-04-04T14:04:44.7933333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3289/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Consalvo of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3289) of Rob Consalvo relative to access to certain data by private detectives and private investigators.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 30A of chapter 90 of the General Laws is hereby amended by inserting after the term “policies,” the following words:- private detectives and private investigators as defined in section 22 of chapter 147 and licensed in accordance with section 25 of chapter 147,  \r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 30 of chapter 147 is hereby amended by adding the following two paragraphs:- \r\n\t12. Use computer data or equipment under the control of the registrar of motor vehicles in accordance with section 30A of chapter 90 for any purpose inconsistent with (2) of section 22 of chapter 147.\r\n\t13. Access the facial recognition system operated by the registry of motor vehicles.\r\n\tAnd by inserting after the term “both” the following words: - provided, the license of a licensee who violates paragraphs 12 and 13 shall be revoked\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}